15. SAFETY PRINCIPLES
==================================================

The platform must:

- Never claim to be a lawyer
- Never guarantee a legal outcome
- Clearly distinguish legal information from professional legal advice
- Show sources
- Show uncertainty
- Ask for missing information
- Avoid hallucinated sections
- Avoid fabricated case law
- Prefer official sources
- Detect outdated law
- Respect jurisdiction
- Protect sensitive user information
- Avoid storing unnecessary personal information
- Provide escalation to qualified legal professionals for high-risk situations

